        }
      }
    },
    "%lld zapped" : {
      "comment" : "How many elements on a site were hidden with Zap Element, like “3 zapped”: a row in the site panel that opens the list of them, and a choice made for a site in Settings › Privacy › Sites.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已隐藏 %lld 个"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已隱藏 %lld 個"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. In 1Password, open Settings › Browser.\n2. Click Add Browser and choose Zigzag.\n3. Come back and click 1Password again.\n\n1Password only works with browsers it trusts, so this is a one-time step." : {
      "comment" : "Steps in the note from the 1Password extension's button. Keep each step on its own line starting with its number and a period (1. 2. 3.); the line after the blank line is a note. Settings › Browser and Add Browser are names in 1Password.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. 在 1Password 中，打开“设置 › 浏览器”。\n2. 点按“添加浏览器”，然后选择 Zigzag。\n3. 回到这里，再次点按 1Password。\n\n1Password 只与它信任的浏览器配合使用，所以这一步只需做一次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. 在 1Password 中，開啟「設定 › 瀏覽器」。\n2. 點一下「新增瀏覽器」，然後選取 Zigzag。\n3. 回到這裡，再次點一下 1Password。\n\n1Password 只與它信任的瀏覽器配合使用，所以這一步只需做一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1Password doesn’t trust Zigzag yet. In 1Password, go to Settings › Browser › Add Browser and choose Zigzag." : {
      "comment" : "Toast when the 1Password app turns Zigzag away. Settings › Browser › Add Browser are names in 1Password; match 1Password's own translation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1Password 还不信任 Zigzag。请在 1Password 中前往“设置 › 浏览器 › 添加浏览器”，然后选择 Zigzag。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1Password 還不信任 Zigzag。請在 1Password 中前往「設定 › 瀏覽器 › 新增瀏覽器」，然後選取 Zigzag。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1Password is waiting for you in its app. Unlock it, or allow Zigzag if it asks." : {
      "comment" : "Toast when the 1Password extension waits on the 1Password app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1Password 正在它的 App 中等你。请解锁它；如果它询问，请允许 Zigzag。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1Password 正在它的 App 中等你。請解鎖它；如果它詢問，請允許 Zigzag。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A blocker stopped this page" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the page Zigzag shows when a content blocker kept a page from loading.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内容拦截器拦下了此页面"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "內容阻擋程式攔下了此網頁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A browser theme. Zigzag doesn’t use them." : {
      "comment" : "One line beside a name, in place of installing it, when it's a browser theme rather than an extension.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是浏览器主题，Zigzag 不使用主题。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是瀏覽器主題，Zigzag 不使用主題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A content blocker doesn’t let this page load. If you trust the site, allow it in the blocker, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a content blocker kept a page from loading.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内容拦截器不允许载入此页面。如果你信任这个网站，请在拦截器中允许它，然后再试一次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "內容阻擋程式不允許載入此網頁。如果你信任這個網站，請在阻擋程式中允許它，然後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A development site at localhost or 127.0.0.1 that uses its own certificate for https opens without the warning. Only for servers on this Mac, and only the certificate first shown." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Trust certificates of servers on this Mac” in Settings › Developer.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "位于 localhost 或 127.0.0.1、使用自有证书提供 https 的开发网站，打开时不再显示警告。仅限这台 Mac 上的服务器，且只信任它最先出示的证书。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "位於 localhost 或 127.0.0.1、使用自有憑證提供 https 的開發網站，開啟時不再顯示警告。僅限這台 Mac 上的伺服器，且只信任它最先出示的憑證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A double-click on the empty space below your tabs opens a new tab. Turned off, it zooms the window, as a title bar does." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Double-click the sidebar for a new tab” in Settings › Appearance.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在标签页下方的空白处双击会新建标签页。关闭后，双击会像标题栏一样缩放窗口。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在分頁下方的空白處按兩下會新增分頁。關閉後，按兩下會像標題列一樣縮放視窗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few of your sign-ins from %@ couldn’t come over, so some sites may ask you to sign in again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. The placeholder is a browser's name, like Chrome. Sign-ins are the sites a browser keeps you signed in to.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 中有少数登录状态未能导入，所以一些网站可能会要求你重新登录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 中有少數登入狀態無法匯入，所以一些網站可能會要求你重新登入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A password can’t be empty." : {
      "comment" : "Toast when saving a login with its password cleared.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "密码不能为空。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請輸入密碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A profile has its own extensions, sign-ins, history and favorites. Spaces on the same profile share them." : {
      "comment" : "Under the title of the sheet that makes a profile.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "个人资料有自己的扩展、登录状态、历史记录和收藏。同一份个人资料中的空间共用这些内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "個人資料有自己的延伸功能、登入狀態、瀏覽記錄和收藏。同一份個人資料中的空間共用這些內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick look, without losing your place" : {
      "comment" : "Under what's said once a step is done, in the getting-started guide, a card in the window, after a link opened in Zigzag Mini.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看一眼，不离开当前位置"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快速瀏覽，不必離開目前的網頁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rule that hasn’t been told asks the first time it fires, and keeps your answer." : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip on the Open in choice of an Open URL download rule.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "还没指定位置的规则会在第一次触发时询问，并记住你的选择。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "還沒指定位置的規則會在第一次觸發時詢問，並記住你的選取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A site covers every port and its subdomains: localhost is localhost:3000 and app.localhost too." : {
      "comment" : "Under the list in Settings › Developer.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个网站涵盖它的所有端口和子域名：localhost 也包括 localhost:3000 和 app.localhost。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "網站規則涵蓋所有連接埠和子網域。例如，localhost 也符合 localhost:3000 和 app.localhost。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A small window for a quick look at a page. Esc closes it, and ⌘O moves it into your browser window to keep it." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “New Zigzag Mini” in Settings › Zigzag Mini: what Zigzag Mini is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用一个小窗口快速看一眼页面。按 Esc 关闭，按 ⌘O 移到浏览器窗口中留下。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用一個小視窗快速看一眼網頁。按 Esc 關閉，按 ⌘O 移到瀏覽器視窗中留下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A space you make gets a profile named after it, with its own sign-ins, extensions and history. Spaces you have now stay on theirs." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Give new spaces their own profile” in Settings › Spaces.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新建的空间会有一份以它命名的个人资料，有自己的登录状态、扩展和历史记录。现有的空间保持不变。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新增的空間會有一份以它命名的個人資料，有自己的登入狀態、延伸功能和瀏覽記錄。現有的空間保持不變。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A style can’t hold a tag like </style>." : {
      "comment" : "Under the code field of the Edit Style sheet, while the CSS holds an HTML tag: why Save can't be pressed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "样式里不能有 </style> 这样的标签。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "樣式裡不能有 </style> 這樣的標籤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A style can’t load anything from the web, with @import or a web address." : {
      "comment" : "Under the code field of the Edit Style sheet, while the CSS imports or loads something from the web: why Save can't be pressed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "样式不能通过 @import 或网址从网上载入任何内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "樣式不能透過 @import 或網址從網路上載入任何內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tab needs your answer" : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip of the glow along the sidebar's edge when one page is waiting for an answer.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个标签页在等你回答"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有一個分頁等你回覆"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tab on %@ is using a lot of energy in the background" : {
      "comment" : "Toast when a tab in the background uses a lot of energy. The site is a domain, like example.com.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 上的一个标签页在后台耗电较多"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 上的一個分頁在背景耗電較多"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tab on %@ is using a lot of energy. It’ll sleep in %lld minutes." : {
      "comment" : "Toast when a background tab keeps the Mac busy. The site is a domain, like example.com; the number is how many minutes until the tab sleeps. A sleeping tab wakes where it was when you open it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "A tab on %1$@ is using a lot of energy. It’ll sleep in %2$lld minutes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ 上的一个标签页耗电较多，%2$lld 分钟后会休眠。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ 上的一個分頁耗電較多，%2$lld 分鐘後會休眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tab on %@ was using a lot of energy, so it’s asleep now" : {
      "comment" : "Toast after Zigzag put a background tab to sleep because it used a lot of energy. The site is a domain, like example.com. The tab wakes when you open it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 上的一个标签页耗电较多，已让它休眠"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 上的一個分頁耗電較多，已讓它休眠"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tab you’re not using that keeps working hard sleeps until you open it again. To keep a site’s tabs awake, turn on Keep tabs awake in its Site Controls." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Put busy background tabs to sleep” in Settings › Tabs. Keep tabs awake is the row in the site panel; site controls is the panel by the address.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没在用却一直占用大量资源的标签页会休眠，再次打开时唤醒。要让某个网站的标签页保持唤醒，请在它的网站设置中打开“标签页保持唤醒”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "沒在用卻一直佔用大量資源的分頁會休眠，再次開啟時喚醒。要讓某個網站的分頁保持喚醒，請在它的網站設定中開啟「分頁保持喚醒」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A web address opens in Zigzag or your default browser. Anything else opens in its own app." : {
      "comment" : "Under the Open in choice of an Open URL download rule: only the web's own addresses are Zigzag's to open.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网页地址在 Zigzag 或默认浏览器中打开，其他地址在各自的 App 中打开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "網址會在 Zigzag 或預設瀏覽器中開啟，其他連結則會交給對應的 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AD" : {
      "comment" : "Label on a sample ad in the welcome window’s picture of Zigzag.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "广告"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "廣告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Space Rule" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the sheet that creates a space rule.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加空间规则"
