    "Glance, then get back to what you were doing. To keep the page, use this button or press %@." : {
      "comment" : "Text of the note shown once in Zigzag Mini, the first time a link from another app opens there. The note points at the Open in button, which (like its keys, such as ⌘O) moves the page into a tab of a browser window.",
