            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟指令列"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Or click + in the sidebar, then choose New Space" : {
      "comment" : "Under the new space step's title in the getting-started guide, a card in the window, after the keys that make a space. New Space is an item in the menu of the sidebar's +.",
      "localizations" : {
