    "You can still bring passwords from an exported .csv file, bookmarks from an exported .html file, or bookmarks and history from Safari’s export (a .zip file)." : {
      "comment" : "Import window, under “No other browsers found on this Mac”: what can still come over from a file.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你仍然可以从导出的 .csv 文件导入密码，从导出的 .html 文件导入书签，或从 Safari 导出的 .zip 文件导入书签和历史记录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你仍然可以從匯出的 .csv 檔案匯入密碼，從匯出的 .html 檔案匯入書籤，或從 Safari 匯出的 .zip 檔案匯入書籤和瀏覽記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You searched YouTube from here" : {
      "comment" : "Said once a step is done in the getting-started guide, a card in the window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
